label chapter_one:

    scene bg class_board at bg_fit with dissolve
    show teachertalking at center_char
    teacher "Everyone... look over here."
    teacher "Yes, yes. You guys don't plan on listening to me either way."
    hide teachertalking
    show sarasmilequiet at center_char
    npc "That's Sara Lee, right?"
    npc "She's so pretty"
    thought "Please stop staring at me like that..."
    thought "I just met you for the first time today..."
    thought "Let me just look somewhere else."
    hide sarasmilequiet
    show wooquiet at center_char
    thought "We're only in the first year of High School, how can he be so handome."
    hide wooquiet 
    show woosmile at center_char
    npc "ACK!!"
    npc "MY HEART!!"
    npc "HE JUST SMILED AT ME!!"
    npc "NO! HE JUST SMILED AT ME!!"
    hide woosmile
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char
    thought "Yeah.. If it was any other day, my reaction would've been like that too."
    thought "But why?!"
    thought "Why doesn't anyone notice their weird hair and eye colors?"
    thought "Come on..."
    thought "Huh? A message?"

    show screen phone_notification("Sara Lee ♡", "Soo-ah, are you sick?")
    pause 2.5
    hide screen phone_notification
    pause 0.3

    thought "Huh?"
    thought "Why on Earth is her phone number saved on my phone?"
    thought "Just like when my uniform suddenly changed..."
    thought "Just what is it?"
    thought "Weird things keep happening to me since this morning..."

    npc1 "Hey you! You were the one that came with those three over there, am I right?"
    soo "Huh? Yeah. Yes, I did."
    npc1 "Do you know them?"
    soo "Ah... we just came in together because I was late."
    soo "We definitely don't know eachother."
    npc2 "Oh really?"
    npc2 "What a pity..."
    npc2 "You know that boy, Min-Ho? Ever since elementary, he's always gone to school in a limousine!"
    npc1 "They say that he's the son of a rich family."
    npc2 "No way! He's good looking and rich as well?"
    npc1 "Yes! He also scored first place out of the whole school!"
    npc2 "Apparently, he and the boy next to him, Woo Ju-In, have been friends since they were little."
    thought "This girl sounds like she's secretly introducing a character..."
    npc2 "It's really easy to get along with Ju-in! He has an amazing personality!"
    npc1 "Aww. He's so cute."
    npc2 "They say his IQ is over 200. Just one look and he remembers everything!"
    npc1 "Wow. He's amazing!"
    npc1 "Eunhyeong also looks like he has a good personality!"
    npc1 "He was picked as the class president by the kids in our school before too!"
    npc2 "Wow, he really is a model student!"
    npc1 "Even the teachers and students love him."
    npc1 "He excels in everything, has a good personality...there's really nothing he can't do."
    thought "Even though he has strange colored hair, he does have a friendly personality."
    npc2 "Hey, what about him?"
    npc2 "Doesn't he look like he's the smartest?"
    npc1 "Yoo Cheon Young?"
    npc1 "He often appears in magazine photos."
    npc1 "He's a celebrity."
    npc1 "Apparently, his uncle is a famous photographer."
    npc1 "But he doesn't really talk."
    npc1 "He doesn't even say one word to girls."
    npc2 "What a pity~"
    npc1 "But he's still so cool~"
    thought "...That's right."
    thought "If the main character existed..."
    thought "It would definitely be Sara Park and the four of them."
    thought "If only it was a novel or a manhwa."
    thought "But isn't this reality?!"
    npc1 "But those guys..."
    npc1 "Can we call them the Four Heavenly Kings?"
    thought "This is definitely a novel..."
    npc2 "Wow, that's perfect!!"
    thought "Something like this cannot be real."

    jump chapter_2
